e holder's dateOfBirth (:35-36). That is why it is red on the stub, whose canned body has no policyholders. Rule: '16 or older on the start date (a 16th birthday on the start date passes), else 422.'</dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Files</dt><dd><a class="kit-file-line-link__link" href="https://github.com/dpmorgandev/uinsure-policies-api/blob/main/tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellPolicyholderAgeTests.cs" aria-label="tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellPolicyholderAgeTests.cs on GitHub" data-line="absent" data-comp="file-line-link · primitive · line absent"><span class="kit-file-line-link__text">tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellPolicyholderAgeTests.cs</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link kit-file-line-link__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a> <a class="kit-file-line-link__link" href="https://github.com/dpmorgandev/uinsure-policies-api/blob/main/tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Support/PoliciesClient.cs" aria-label="tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Support/PoliciesClient.cs on GitHub" data-line="absent" data-comp="file-line-link · primitive · line absent"><span class="kit-file-line-link__text">tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Support/PoliciesClient.cs</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link kit-file-line-link__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field